      "id": 0,
      "message": "\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5999175959314438812\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F97BD.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🗽\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e Anyone \u003cb\u003eunder 25\u003c/b\u003e can win \u003cb\u003e€100,000\u003c/b\u003e for an essay on \u003cb\u003edigital freedoms\u003c/b\u003e. The \u003cb\u003eYouth Liberty Prize 2026\u003c/b\u003e supports young thinkers ready to defend freedom from threats like censorship, surveillance, digital IDs and CBDCs.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eStand for freedom and win \u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5305517652721022708\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29C8A.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e✊\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eFull details: \u003ca href=\"https://www.libertyprize.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003ehttps://www.libertyprize.org/\u003c/a\u003e",
