      "id": 0,
      "message": "\u003cb\u003e41\u003c/b\u003e kidnappings of crypto holders in France in \u003cb\u003e3.5\u003c/b\u003e months of \u003cb\u003e2026\u003c/b\u003e.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eWhy?\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5222351452189509927\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA596.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🥖\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e French tax officials selling crypto owners\u0026#39; data to criminals (Ghalia C.) + massive tax database leaks.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eNow the same state also wants IDs and private messages of social media users.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eMore data =\u0026gt; More leaks =\u0026gt; More victims.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eThat’s why Telegram would rather leave the French market than give their corrupt bureaucrats access to private messages.  \u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5357166373917184514\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F90B6.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🐶\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e",
